id: pm-github-wrmt
title: Regenerate caller changelogs and dispatch required CI for gated sync PRs
description: "Make gated sync reviews independently mergeable with an overridable caller npm script, a final privacy scan including CHANGELOG.md, and explicit caller CI workflow dispatch after PR creation or update. Fleet adoption remains tracked by pm-github-aiok."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: changelog-unreleased
created_at: "2026-10-14T11:43:07.998Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-14T13:10:18.217Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-14T11:43:26.402Z",codex-agent,"Measured fleet use: pm-gantt-chart#142 was blocked because bot PR workflows ended action_required and imported closed issues changed the generated changelog. Plan: run caller post-import command, stage CHANGELOG.md with tracker data, scan an explicit combined diff before health and publication, then dispatch configured caller workflows on the pushed branch. Test with real local git repositories and HTTP fixtures; record behavioural revert proofs. No duplicate feature found; fleet rollout is separate in pm-github-aiok."
  "2026-10-14T11:48:40.689Z",codex-agent,"Implemented post-import-run and ci-workflows with documented defaults, actions: write, combined tracker/changelog diff scanning, dispatch after successful PR publication, and approval-required run URL notices. Typecheck, test compilation, lint, and generated changelog check pass. Initial linked whole-file run exceeded the runner default 120-second budget; link the focused workflow regressions with an explicit 900-second command budget. Required release gates retain unchanged thresholds and internal import deadlines."
  "2026-10-14T11:53:36.296Z",codex-agent,"Focused workflow regressions: 4/4 pass, zero failures/cancellations/skips/todo. Behavioural revert proofs (workflow shell only, unchanged tests): removing the post-import execution fails the published changelog assertion (0/1 pass); excluding CHANGELOG.md from the explicit final diff fails because the secret-bearing local sync succeeds (0/1 pass); removing gh workflow run fails for missing dispatch receipts (0/1 pass). All changes restored. Fixtures use real git repositories, bare remotes, the packed candidate with the pinned host CLI, and local HTTP responses; no live GitHub test writes."
  "2026-10-14T12:04:50.070Z",codex-agent,"The complete standalone workflow/import-gate suite passed 34/34 with zero failures, cancellations, skips, or todo, including the native Bun repeat-import deadlines. The final linked focused run (pm test pm-github-wrmt --run --progress) passed 4/4 with an explicit 900-second command budget and no failures/cancellations/skips/todo. Strict health with merge-driver verification passed; one pre-existing advisory covers four stale in-progress items. Full isolated npm and Bun release gates remain required before delivery."
  "2026-10-14T12:21:35.364Z",codex-agent,"Initial isolated npm gate: 583/584 tests passed; the sole failure was the canonical publish-attestation auditor rejecting opaque Bash execution of a caller command. Keep that safety gate unchanged. Final input is post-import-script, default changelog:full, invoked through explicit npm run --if-present with a validated script name; callers override the npm script name or disable with an empty string. Updated fixtures use caller package scripts, including failing and secret-generating scripts. Typecheck, lint and attestation verification pass; repeat focused tests, revert proofs and both isolated release gates on this final design."
  "2026-10-14T12:27:24.824Z",codex-agent,"Final named-script design: linked pm test run passed 5/5, with zero failures/cancellations/skips/todo. Four behavioural reverts with unchanged tests each failed (0/1, exit 1): remove npm script execution -> stale published changelog; exclude CHANGELOG.md from final diff -> synthetic secret reaches local push; remove gh workflow run -> missing dispatch receipts; remove script-name validation -> raw-command input succeeds. Restored all changes. Canonical attestation check passes without exceptions or threshold changes. Repeating both full release gates under isolated HOME, unset PM_PATH/PM_AUTHOR, and disabled global/system git config."
  "2026-10-14T12:47:18.176Z",codex-agent,"Final isolated npm release:check passed (exit 0): 584/584 tests, zero failures/cancellations/skips/todo; full coverage gate passed at unchanged four 100-percent thresholds; source duplication zero; privacy, docstrings, typecheck, build, lint, production audit, pack, changelog check and canonical publish attestation all passed. Next gate is isolated bun run release:check on unchanged implementation."
  "2026-10-14T13:10:16.298Z",codex-agent,"Final isolated bun run release:check passed (exit 0): 584/584 tests, zero failures/cancellations/skips/todo. Both npm and Bun measured 12 authored modules with 9584/9584 lines and statements, 234/234 functions, and 2557/2557 branches: exact 100/100/100/100, no skipped source. Both release gates passed typecheck, build, docstrings, lint, zero duplication, privacy, production audit (zero vulnerabilities), pack, changelog check and canonical attestation at unchanged thresholds. Final linked workflow regressions passed 5/5; all four behavioural reverts failed as expected. Delivery is the fix/sync-pr-ci-and-changelog review branch; callers must repin the workflow and package release, grant actions: write and expose matching required checks via workflow_dispatch. Release the claim without closing this Feature; the orchestrator verifies and closes it."
